{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"Galois 扩张"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Galois扩张"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>Galois 扩张是域的平展景上以离散群为结构群的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Galois主丛","text":"Galois 主丛"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>域的 <strong>Galois 扩张</strong>是"},{"Local":{"url":"正规扩张","text":"正规"}},{"Plain":"且"},{"Local":{"url":"可分扩张","text":"可分"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"代数扩张","text":"代数扩张"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>有限 Galois 扩张</h3>\n<p>域的<strong>有限 Galois 扩张</strong>是满足如下等价条件的扩张 $F\\subset E$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$F\\subset E$ 是 Galois 扩张, 且是有限扩张.</li>\n<li>$E$ 是 $F$ 上某个可分多项式的"},{"Local":{"url":"分裂域","text":"分裂域"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>$E$ 是 $F$ 的有限扩张, 且 $E^{\\operatorname{Aut}_F(E)} = F$;</li>\n<li>存在有限子群 $G\\subset\\operatorname{Aut}(E)$ 使得 $F=E^G$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>Galois 对应</h3>\n<p>对于有限 Galois 扩张 $F\\subset E$, 有双射\n$$\r\n\\{F\\subset E\\text{ 的中间域}\\} \\leftrightarrow \\{\\operatorname{Gal}(E/F) \\text{ 的子群}\\},\r\n$$\n将中间域 $F\\subset M\\subset E$ 对应到子群 $\\operatorname{Aut}(E/M)\\subset\\operatorname{Gal}(E/F)$; 且</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$M/F$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"正规扩张","text":"正规扩张"}},{"Plain":"当且仅当 $\\operatorname{Aut}(E/M)\\subset\\operatorname{Gal}(E/F)$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"正规子群","text":"正规子群"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<p>此时有"},{"Local":{"url":"群短正合列","text":"短正合列"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n1\\to \\operatorname{Aut}(E/M) \\to \\operatorname{Gal}(E/F) \\to \\operatorname{Gal}(M/F) \\to 1.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>复合</h3>\n<p>设 $F\\subset M\\subset E$ 是两个域扩张.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>若 $F\\subset E$ 是 Galois 扩张, 则 $M\\subset E$ 是 Galois 扩张.</li>\n<li>当 $F\\subset E$ 是 Galois 扩张时, $F\\subset M$ 不一定是 Galois 扩张 (考虑 $\\mathbb{Q}\\subset\\mathbb{Q}(\\sqrt[3]{2})\\subset\\mathbb{Q}(\\sqrt[3]{2},\\omega)$).</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>“函子性”</h3>\n<p>在以下两个命题中, 设 $F\\subset E_1$, $F\\subset E_2$ 为域扩张, 且 $E_1$, $E_2$ 同时包含于某个更大的域. 记 $E_1\\cup E_2$ 生成的域为 $E_1E_2$.</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 若 $F\\subset E_1$ 为 Galois 扩张, 则 $E_2\\subset E_1E_2$ 为 Galois 扩张, 且有自然的嵌入\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Gal}(E_1E_2 / E_2) \\hookrightarrow \\operatorname{Gal}(E_1 / F).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 若 $F\\subset E_1$ 为 Galois 扩张且 $E_1\\cap E_2 = F$, 则上述嵌入为同构.</p>\n"}]}}